{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj44wHyVujvJoteFsFxS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient oak, iron-banded, silent.*\n\n*A keyhole glints at its center, dark and waiting.*\n\n*You hold a key. Just... a key. No teeth. No ward. No bow. A blank.*\n\n*The keyhole does not turn. The lock does not yield.*\n\n*The door remains.*\n\n**LOCKED.**\n\n*What key do you bring?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":94,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}